{"sessionId":"L1-S17","number":17,"sessionTitle":"Light in the Dark","title":"The Old Railway Tunnel","titleCard":{"text":"Episode 17. The Old Railway Tunnel.","file":"/kids/audio/l1/L1-S17/title.ogg","dur":3.461,"env":"0005szr30gqtqlwzzzr2gqqpzlrvwfalpztstrqng20000000000iyud5cywwzzp9b4lszzxxzyxvujqussq40jhmzutvvtqf0000000","words":[["Episode",0.11,0.99],["17.",0.99,1.36],["The",1.73,2.0],["Old",2.0,2.27],["Railway",2.27,2.78],["Tunnel.",2.78,3.23]],"voice":"narrator"},"previously":{"text":"The robot waited for the bridges. Eight lights! They pointed into a dark tunnel…","file":"/kids/audio/l1/L1-S17/prev.ogg","dur":6.389,"env":"000qxzwtnemki3920jcsusrsssssrpla00000000000pxxzzzu7sxpf80vzzve2gfl528vts8ozzj0ljtqphkke30000000000mzzzl39i7pxzwvtttn6008nqnlg600000000003zwc00cbzyzzz7ivv5ewwuedvzi2zzyyta690oiizuxvuspoe0000000","words":[["Last",0.1,0.57],["time...",0.57,1.05],["The",1.43,1.61],["robot",1.61,1.88],["waited",1.88,2.18],["for",2.18,2.37],["the",2.37,2.55],["bridges.",2.55,2.9],["Eight",3.27,3.69],["lights!",3.69,4.18],["They",4.54,4.8],["pointed",4.8,5.19],["into",5.19,5.44],["a",5.44,5.55],["dark",5.55,5.81],["tunnel…",5.81,6.15]],"voice":"narrator"},"scenes":[{"setting":"The tunnel mouth. Inside: pure darkness.","action":"Spark flies in a little and immediately bumps the wall — “ow!” — and flies back out.","seconds":30,"lines":[{"i":0,"who":"spark","guestName":null,"text":"My camera eyes see nothing! Cameras need light, just like your eyes.","direction":null,"file":"/kids/audio/l1/L1-S17/0.ogg","dur":5.187,"env":"03ytuwl6b9ospqfmuqqm73gnmnkillnnmxsuimqlnpmfxsn646smhcd8000000039buvqjkqstmnkdeljjb44mpomnllf30b70000000000000006kzrbre5krqlg4335pqmb4honligf9933jic70000000","words":[["My",0.08,0.29],["camera",0.29,0.74],["eyes",0.74,1.08],["see",1.08,1.35],["nothing!",1.35,1.86],["Cameras",2.15,2.71],["need",2.71,3.08],["light,",3.08,3.52],["just",3.52,3.88],["like",3.88,4.25],["your",4.25,4.62],["eyes.",4.62,4.99]],"voice":"spark"},{"i":1,"who":"amara","guestName":null,"text":"And in the dark, nobody could see our robot coming.","direction":null,"file":"/kids/audio/l1/L1-S17/1.ogg","dur":3.362,"env":"00000000gxyzzxzzzzywrtssqrql300642005yzvyqdrttxxp7zwxfalkqtwstsrqqwuuioe3288osrslkjnrs900000000000000","words":[["And",0.15,0.39],["in",0.39,0.58],["the",0.58,0.82],["dark,",0.82,1.12],["nobody",1.12,1.53],["could",1.53,1.88],["see",1.88,2.12],["our",2.12,2.36],["robot",2.36,2.71],["coming.",2.71,3.12]],"voice":"amara"}]},{"setting":"Nana Lucía holds up a torch, switching it on and off.","action":"Off: black. On: the beam hits a wall and the wall appears. Little arrows show light bouncing from the wall into Spark’s eye.","seconds":45,"lines":[{"i":2,"who":"lucia","guestName":null,"text":"Light shines out, bounces off things and comes back into eyes and cameras. That is how we see.","direction":null,"file":"/kids/audio/l1/L1-S17/2.ogg","dur":7.472,"env":"009qwyrk0poqpfvtpooqoqqmrjtrqqrokg40dg200000000000000wxvroqnojsto9jqpprrnh9bb33qrmprsoolooi0ejrnqqnuc0mvutqkb0bpngjdn90bqrqsrtsrkquhoonccelrnpomonommlmliirqlh800000000000000murqe0kkouui8fhoutroqojnuohutvsxtbrroomlikjhb000000","words":[["Light",0.1,0.52],["shines",0.52,1.01],["out,",1.01,1.31],["bounces",1.31,1.86],["off",1.86,2.16],["things",2.16,2.65],["and",2.65,2.94],["comes",2.94,3.36],["back",3.36,3.72],["into",3.72,4.08],["eyes",4.08,4.44],["and",4.44,4.73],["cameras.",4.73,5.29],["That",5.78,6.16],["is",6.16,6.4],["how",6.4,6.71],["we",6.71,6.95],["see.",6.95,7.26]],"voice":"lucia"},{"i":3,"who":"lucia","guestName":null,"text":"A light uses battery energy. So we switch it on in the dark, and off in the light.","direction":null,"file":"/kids/audio/l1/L1-S17/3.ogg","dur":5.713,"env":"003rtuutwxvvm0qiatvlqwtglnst700pxwvvecgwvuto60lvsrssn74qdrnljgc4000000000000008hjmeurrtlhnn93ro0mjp6qpptvttvuhbrqoomlkld0060000000004tuqusrma38ostusrqsurpnnnook908d50000000","words":[["A",0.11,0.27],["light",0.27,0.69],["uses",0.69,1.05],["battery",1.05,1.61],["energy.",1.61,2.1],["So",2.61,2.78],["we",2.78,2.95],["switch",2.95,3.32],["it",3.32,3.5],["on",3.5,3.67],["in",3.67,3.84],["the",3.84,4.07],["dark,",4.07,4.34],["and",4.34,4.56],["off",4.56,4.78],["in",4.78,4.96],["the",4.96,5.18],["light.",5.18,5.5]],"voice":"lucia"}]},{"setting":"Toolbox on the dock.","action":"The scoop clicks off; the headlight clicks on.","seconds":30,"lines":[{"i":4,"who":"spark","guestName":null,"text":"Scoop off. Headlight on! A new tool for a new job.","direction":null,"file":"/kids/audio/l1/L1-S17/4.ogg","dur":4.201,"env":"04xu65dwuur74000qrrplf665540000000004nzw7ajorqpoqsqh534lpokif7500000000zwuzsutuvrh497suoj5457ponfhjfmsqqok63lwwqrlmmkg62000000","words":[["Scoop",0.07,0.57],["off.",0.57,0.91],["Headlight",1.21,1.87],["on!",1.87,2.09],["A",2.38,2.52],["new",2.52,2.78],["tool",2.78,3.09],["for",3.09,3.34],["a",3.34,3.48],["new",3.48,3.74],["job.",3.74,3.99]],"voice":"spark"},{"i":5,"who":"spark","guestName":null,"text":"When should we switch the light on? Before the tunnel or after?","direction":"Pause.","file":"/kids/audio/l1/L1-S17/5.ogg","dur":3.569,"env":"06srnkgtnjzl9jvrnors7auq3co92iuqrwwxyul6nkhhc9600000000si789qwzzwfjq4eg8nljjolh47snnmj9irutqk6666fnjb000000","words":[["When",0.08,0.29],["should",0.29,0.58],["we",0.58,0.72],["switch",0.72,1.0],["the",1.0,1.18],["light",1.18,1.43],["on?",1.43,1.56],["Before",1.85,2.23],["the",2.23,2.46],["tunnel",2.46,2.85],["or",2.85,3.03],["after?",3.03,3.36]],"voice":"spark"}]},{"setting":"Inside the tunnel, lit by the robot’s headlight.","action":"The beam shows old rails, puddles and, on the ceiling, tiny blue glow-worms. Spark gasps. They walk through together.","seconds":40,"lines":[{"i":6,"who":"myrobot","guestName":null,"text":"Light on!","direction":null,"file":"/kids/audio/l1/L1-S17/6.ogg","dur":0.815,"env":"003kwtmh4jnoopige84000000","words":[["Light",0.1,0.43],["on!",0.43,0.61]],"voice":"myrobot"},{"i":7,"who":"amara","guestName":null,"text":"Glow-worms! Like the caves in New Zealand!","direction":null,"file":"/kids/au